<title>UK: Banco Bansud sets $100 million two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Bansud sets $100 million two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Bear Stearns International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO BANSUD SA</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	COUPON     **	  MATURITY    02.NOV.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE  S-05.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+350 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10+1</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.50	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND TWO-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
